WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.130
A crowded ballroom, seen from above.

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.020
Couples weave in two long lines.

3
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:10.070
One tall man walks about
the room, and barely dances.

4
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.890
He has "ten thousand a year".

5
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.700
For half the evening the room admires him.

6
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.110
Then it decides he's proud.

7
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.490
A young woman is sitting out nearby.

8
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:25.630
She hears him call her "tolerable:
but not handsome enough to tempt me".

9
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:29.850
Yet by Volume II, this same
man is proposing to her.

10
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.450
So who changes?

11
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.590
In this mission, you'll see how wealth,
status and pride shape the first impression

12
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.670
he makes.

13
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.150
And you'll take apart his first proposal,

14
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.090
the novel's turning point, line by
line, to find out how it goes wrong.

15
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.530
Your mission: work out
who changes, and how.
